                </div>
                <h2 class="fw-bold mb-2">e-TAKAF</h2>
                <p class="mb-1 small">PORTAL CARIAN MAKLUMAT TANAH WAKAF</p>
                <p class="mb-0 small">NEGERI SEMBILAN</p>
